### get cats
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/cats

### get cat with id
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/cats/1

### post cat
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/cats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Buffy",
  "birthdate": "2022-04-20",
  "weight": 3.5,
  "owner": "Blob",
  "image": "/images/200.jpg"
}
